{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15073","headline":"清明日赐百僚新火 · 韩濬","name":"清明日赐百僚新火","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"改火清明後，优恩赐近臣。\n漏残丹禁晚，燧发白榆新。\n瑞彩来双阙，神光焕四邻。\n气回侯第暖，烟散帝城春。\n利用调羹鼎，余辉烛缙绅。\n皇明如照隐，愿及聚萤人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩濬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}